, "Preview", "ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "image_ref", "link": 95, "label": "image_ref", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_ref"}, {"name": "image_target", "link": 50, "label": "image_target", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_target"}, {"widget": {"name": "method"}, "name": "method", "label": "method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "method"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_output"}, "name": "image_output", "label": "image_output", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image_output"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_prefix"}, "name": "save_prefix", "label": "save_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "save_prefix"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 26, "type": "easy imageColorMatch", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "e900c2ca9c0d90b0896881910ca7f3f02d88ebd8", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy imageColorMatch"}, "order": 32}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#4a7b4a", "widgets_values": ["模型地址：\nhttps://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler\n\n型号：选择您的 DiT 型号\n\n3B 型号：速度更快，显存需求更低\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensorsFP8 8位（高质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q8_0.ggufGGUF 8 位量化（高质量）\n\n7B 型号：画质更高，显存需求更高\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors：FP8，最后一个数据块使用FP16，以减少伪影（质量良好）\n\nseedvr2_ema_7b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_*：锐化版本，增强细节\n设备：用于 DiT 推理的 GPU 设备（例如，cuda:0）\n\noffload_device：当 DiT 模型不处于活跃处理状态时，用于卸载 DiT 模型的设备\n\nnone：将模型保存在推理设备（速度最快、显存最大的设备）上\ncpu：卸载到系统内存（减少显存）\ncuda:X：将负载转移到另一块GPU（如果可用，则可获得良好的负载均衡）\ncache_model：在工作流运行之间，保持卸载设备上的 DiT 模型加载状态\n\n适用于批量处理，避免重复加载\n需要设置 offload_device\nblocks_to_swap：块交换内存优化\n\n0：已禁用（默认）\n1-32：需要替换为 3B 型号的变压器模块数量\n1-36：需要更换为 7B 型号的变压器模块数量\n数值越高，节省的显存越多，但处理速度越慢。\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nswap_io_components：卸载输入/输出嵌入和归一化层\n\n结合 blocks_to_swap 可进一步节省 VRAM\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nattention_mode：注意力计算后端\n\nsdpa: PyTorch scaled_dot_product_attention（默认值，稳定，始终可用）\nflash_attnFlash Attention 2（在支持的硬件上速度更快，需要 flash-attn 软件包）\ntorch_compile_args：连接到 SeedVR2 Torch 编译设置节点，可提升 20-40% 的速度。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335533", "size": [495.0076599121094, 850.5523071289062], "pos": [3894.1513671875, 1036.143798828125], "id": 42, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [74], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [210, 46], "pos": [3512.8828125, 549.4161376953125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 70, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "latent", "link": 71, "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}], "flags": {}, "id": 60, "type": "ReferenceLatent", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.6.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ReferenceLatent"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [75], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [210, 26], "pos": [3512.8828125, 655.4161376953125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 72, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}], "flags": {}, "id": 61, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.6.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for